<title>USA: Virginia $56 mln school notes won by Lehman.</title>
<headline>Virginia $56 mln school notes won by Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it won Virginia Public School Authority's $55.9 million note issue at a true interest cost of 4.171 percent.</p>
